Fena links up with the iconic Jamby "Fyah Mummah" Koikai; an Endowarrior, Queen of reggae music in Kenya, and for the first time an independent political candidate in the 2022 general elections.

We tackle representation of women and youth leadership in Kenya, the worrying plight of Kenyans and using artistry for social change.

Rise Up!

Stream and follow Fena on Spotify: shorturl.at/bY038
