Chocolate City Music in collaboration with Reel TV presents THE RISE OF THE QUEEN a reality series covering Victoria Kimani behind the scenes for the last couple of months. The crew follows her as she puts out work, from shows to interviews with some of the biggest names in the Nigerian entertainment scene and media, to her opening for the legendary Mary J Blige. 
The show, which will start airing online weekly from the Tuesday  8th of April @ 1pm on Victoria's YouTube channel
@VICTORIA_KIMANI

